OL,3,GNEWSACouncil homes empty for more than
OL,4,Atwo months
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil homes in Cambridge are sitting
OL,7,Fempty for more than two months on
OL,8,Faverage after being vacated by their
OL,9,Ftenants, according to the city council.
OL,11,FA report published by the local
OL,12,Fauthority said it took an average of
OL,13,F66.7 days to re-let a standard empty
OL,14,Fhome in the second quarter of this
OL,15,Ffinancial year.
OL,17,FThat timescale had improved from about
OL,18,F70 days in the previous quarter, but
OL,19,Fremained behind the council's target of
OL,20,F25 days.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
