OL,3,GNEWSACouncil homes empty for more than
OL,4,Atwo months
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerri Bird, the Labour councillor
OL,7,Fresponsible for housing, said her
OL,8,Fcolleagues were "working hard" to bring
OL,9,Fthe average down.
